{'symbol': 'BKR', 'date': '2022-11-17 02:40:00', 'title': 'TECHNIP ENERGIES AND BAKER HUGHES TO COLLABORATE ON A 1 TO 2 MTPA RANGE MODULARIZED LNG SOLUTION', 'text': 'PARIS--( BUSINESS WIRE )--TECHNIP ENERGIES (PARIS:TE) (ISIN:NL0014559478) AND BAKER HUGHES (NASDAQ: BKR), TWO LEADING ENERGY TECHNOLOGY COMPANIES, ANNOUNCED THURSDAY A MEMORANDUM OF UNDERSTANDING (MOU) THAT SETS THE GROUNDWORK FOR THEIR COOPERATION ON THE JOINT DEVELOPMENT OF A NEW ABOVE 1 AND UP TO 2 MILLION TONS PER ANNUM (MTPA) RANGE LIQUEFIED NATURAL GAS (LNG) MODULARIZED SOLUTION FOR THE ONSHORE MARKET.'}